  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/MercadetMansUnidesOndaCoprodeli.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(28 fotos) Manos Unidas de Onda ha abierto el mercadillo de artesan&iacute;a andina de la Fundaci&oacute;n Coprodeli, en el paseo peatonal del Pla, en la antigua cafeter&iacute;a De Gust y frente a la puerta del Juzgado de Paz.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/ExpoCoprodeliMansUnides.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 680px;\" /></p>\n<p>Est&aacute; abierto de lunes a s&aacute;bado de 17 a 20 horas. y jueves, s&aacute;bado y domingo, tambi&eacute;n de 10 a 13 horas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciomanosunidasdivendres/img_9845.jpg\" alt=\"img_9845\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciomanosunidasdivendres/img_9848.jpg\" alt=\"img_9848\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciomanosunidasdivendres/img_9849.jpg\" alt=\"img_9849\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciomanosunidasdivendres/img_9851.jpg\" alt=\"img_9851\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciomanosunidasdivendres/img_9854.jpg\" alt=\"img_9854\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciomanosunidasdivendres/img_9857.jpg\" alt=\"img_9857\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciomanosunidasdivendres/img_9860.jpg\" alt=\"img_9860\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-91